    "updated_at": "2017-02-07T11:10:17Z",
    "body": "Oh, I didn't review this thread before reviewing, my bad. I'm a little skeptical we'll have enough open issues/PRs to warrant two links and clicks for people that are just interested in what's going on. E.g., currently there are no open issues and I would expect those to be mostly filed against the standard since they're likely due to lack of interop.\r\n\r\nIf folks feel strongly I'm happy to go with separate links for now though. I don't think we can just use \"PR\". We should make it \"pull request\".",
