    "updated_at": "2017-02-08T00:54:27Z",
    "body": "I would be quite happy with a single link to https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/labels/fullscreen and calling it simply \"open issues\" even though it includes PRs. \"ongoing work\" might not be so accurate for other specs where there are long-lived tracking bugs for missing test coverage and the like.\r\n\r\nAs for the link text, does \"web-platform-tests fullscreen\" work? Between web-platform-tests and Web Platform Tests, I have an affinity for the former, and I think @jgraham does too.",
